@startuml
title SA-ROLE02 · 运行、人工介入和发布角色
caption UC-04～08 / BR-02～11、27～39、45～51 / To-Be Proposed
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName PingFang SC
skinparam shadowing false
left to right direction
actor "需求主负责人" as Owner
actor "有权操作者" as User
actor "原发起设备" as Device
actor "获授权维护／发布角色" as Ops
rectangle "平台运行责任" {
 usecase "发起与固化配置" as Start
 usecase "查看、回复、单角色重试" as Intervene
 usecase "执行、续跑、回报证据" as Execute
 usecase "核对原请求及适用放行" as Reconcile
}
Owner --> Start
User --> Intervene
Device --> Execute
Ops --> Reconcile
note bottom of Intervene : 取消待答仅限发起人。\n其他聊天与放行资格仍需定案。
@enduml
